# Copy to .env.local and set your key.
# Vite (dev/build) loads .env, .env.local, and .env.[mode] from the project root.
# For Tauri: the key is read from the environment (or .env in the project root when running the app).
# For browser/Vite build: Vite inlines this at build time, so the key is visible in the client bundle.
# For production browser builds, use a backend proxy so the key is never in the frontend.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
